---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'; import Label from '../components/Label.astro'; import {exhibits,allHalls,href} from '../lib/museum';
const entries=await exhibits(); const real=entries.filter(e=>e.data.status==='published'&&!e.data.demo); const hours=real.reduce((s,e)=>s+e.data.stuckHours,0); const crossed=real.filter(e=>e.data.outcome!=='unsolved').length;
---
<Layout><section class="hero"><div class="eyebrow">常设展览 / THE MUSEUM OF ONE QUESTION</div><h1>做东西的时候，<br/>总有一下<span class="accent">推不动。</span></h1><div class="hero-lower"><p>这里收藏那些真实的阻力。<br/>从屏幕到身体，从一个问题到另一个问题。<br/>你也可以伸手，碰一下。</p><a class="text-link" href={href('exhibits/001/')}>从 001 号开始参观 →</a></div></section><section class="stats" aria-label="体验密度统计"><p>至今共卡住 <strong>{hours}</strong> 小时，<br class="mobile"/>穿过 <strong>{crossed}</strong> 个问题</p><small>真实记录统计 · 不含示范及筹展占位<br/>目前另有 1 件示范展品，2 件筹展中</small></section><div class="section-head"><h2>按问题，走进展厅</h2><span>四间展厅 / 没有固定路线</span></div>{allHalls(entries).map((hall,i)=><section class="hall"><div class="hall-heading"><span class="hall-number">0{i+1}</span><h2>{hall}</h2><span>{entries.filter(e=>e.data.hall===hall).length} 件</span></div><div class="labels">{entries.filter(e=>e.data.hall===hall).map(entry=><Label entry={entry}/>)}{!entries.some(e=>e.data.hall===hall)&&<p class="empty">展柜暂时空着。等待下一个真实的问题。</p>}</div></section>)}<aside class="closing"><p>没有解出来的，<br/>也值得被留下。</p><a class="text-link" href={href('unsolved/')}>进入未解决展区 →</a></aside></Layout>
